* Switching stand-in: f = 2.524e11 / (R_RT || 1meg internal); R47 270k gives 1.187 MHz, RT open gives 252 kHz
.subckt OSCRT RT SW VIN GND
Vref ref GND 1
Rs ref RT 1
Rint RT GND 1meg
Bph ph GND V=idt(2.524e11*I(Rs))
Bsw SW GND V=V(VIN)*(0.5+0.5*tanh(20*sin(2*pi*V(ph))))
.ends
V1 IN 0 4
XU1 RT SW IN 0 OSCRT
R47 RT 0 270k
L1 SW OUT 2.2u
C1 OUT 0 10u
Rload OUT 0 10
.tran 0 100u 0 10n
.end
